+Subject: [PATCH] phy: rockchip: inno-usb2: Add clkout_ctl_phy support
+
+The 480m clk is controlled using regs in the PHY address space and not
+in the USB GRF address space on e.g. RK3528 and RK3506.
+
+Add a clkout_ctl_phy usb2phy_reg to handle enable/disable of the 480m
+clk on these SoCs, and the phy_base regmap they live in. The usbgrf
+lookup condition is extended to devices whose DT provides the phandle
+(e.g. RK3528). Rebased onto the unrefactored driver so the series
+applies across all 24.10.x kernel point releases.
+
+---
+--- a/drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-inno-usb2.c	2026-09-05 14:38:08.642211100 +0800
++++ b/drivers/phy/rockchip/phy-rockchip-inno-usb2.c	2026-09-05 14:38:40.760210300 +0800
